WEBVTT

00:23.760 --> 00:25.960
What is a human's

00:26.480 --> 00:27.680
greatest driving force?

00:38.160 --> 00:43.000
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

00:46.760 --> 00:47.840
Power.

01:18.240 --> 01:19.560
Hatred.

01:30.640 --> 01:32.760
Today, I was really angry at the cleaner.

01:35.120 --> 01:37.520
I wrote about her.
I don't know what will happen.

01:38.840 --> 01:41.320
They are only words.
She won't actually die, right?

01:43.800 --> 01:45.440
If anyone finds out, I'm screwed.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.440
I'm fucking scared.

02:02.440 --> 02:04.240
BAM, ARE YOU FREE TOMORROW MORNING?

02:04.320 --> 02:07.800
CAN YOU LOOK FOR MY SHIRT FOR ME?
I CAN'T FIND IT. I NEED IT.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.479
THANKS. I'M GOING TO BED. GOOD NIGHT.

02:16.400 --> 02:17.840
OKAY, O.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.400
NIGHT NIGHT.

02:48.040 --> 02:51.080
This is a human's greatest driving force.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.160
TODAY, I WAS REALLY ANGRY AT THE CLEANER.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.080
I WROTE ABOUT HER.
I DON'T KNOW WHAT WILL HAPPEN.

02:53.160 --> 02:54.720
THEY ARE ONLY WORDS.
SHE WON'T ACTUALLY DIE, RIGHT?

02:54.800 --> 02:55.920
IF ANYONE FINDS OUT, I'M SCREWED.
I'M FUCKING SCARED.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.200
Fear.

04:38.520 --> 04:40.560
-Who did this to her?
-I can't believe it.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.600
I knew it.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.840
This is horrible.

04:47.520 --> 04:50.960
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

04:57.520 --> 04:59.280
What a pity.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.440
-Why did she do it?
-What happened?

05:02.800 --> 05:05.360
-How come?
-Is this real?

05:05.800 --> 05:07.040
What?

05:10.520 --> 05:12.160
This is horrible, Bam.

05:13.560 --> 05:14.920
She hanged herself.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.760
She suffocated to death.

05:22.920 --> 05:25.720
I don't understand why she killed herself.

05:26.880 --> 05:28.120
Whenever I saw her,

05:29.160 --> 05:30.640
she always seemed just fine.

05:31.320 --> 05:32.440
Right, Bam?

05:34.360 --> 05:35.200
Right.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.840
-Maybe it was murder.
-No way.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.920
I'm just saying.

05:42.480 --> 05:44.560
Her children are still in school.

05:46.400 --> 05:49.120
Why would she kill herself, Bam?

05:57.440 --> 05:59.560
Her children are still in school.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.600
Yes, they're good kids, too.

06:04.120 --> 06:06.320
Maybe it was murder.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.240
You killed her, didn't you?

06:13.360 --> 06:14.280
What are you saying?

06:14.760 --> 06:16.240
I saw your writing on the wall.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.240
Is it really enchanted?

07:20.560 --> 07:21.960
How did she survive?

07:22.040 --> 07:23.560
I saw her. She was dead.

07:23.640 --> 07:25.200
Yes, that was scary.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.800
Jan said she just sat right up.

07:26.880 --> 07:28.760
Hey, how is the cleaner?

07:28.840 --> 07:30.920
She didn't die.

07:31.000 --> 07:32.120
It's terrifying.

07:32.200 --> 07:34.400
She just sat up and talked
like nothing happened.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.040
I see.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.480
-Scary.
-Damn right.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.440
-Nanno.
-Yes?

07:54.160 --> 07:55.160
What is it?

07:55.240 --> 07:57.480
-Why are you crying?
-I just saw her yesterday.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.760
Well...

08:00.320 --> 08:03.000
Do you think you can handle class today?

08:03.360 --> 08:06.360
Do you want something to drink?
I'll get you something. Come on.

08:06.440 --> 08:08.840
Don't go. I'm scared.

08:08.920 --> 08:12.000
All students should avoid
the ground floor corridor.

08:12.080 --> 08:15.040
And there will be no assembly
this morning.

08:15.760 --> 08:17.360
Students, go to your classrooms.

08:17.440 --> 08:18.920
I can stay here with you.

08:32.280 --> 08:34.000
-Hey!
-Nanno!

08:37.120 --> 08:38.000
Nanno!

08:39.000 --> 08:40.880
No!

08:40.960 --> 08:42.360
-Nanno!
-No.

08:43.720 --> 08:45.640
Nanno, what's happening?

08:46.320 --> 08:47.240
No!

08:47.320 --> 08:48.920
What is it?

08:49.640 --> 08:53.600
ZIT-FACE NANNO

08:54.800 --> 08:55.920
Miss...

08:56.840 --> 08:58.440
Are you all right?

08:59.440 --> 09:00.960
If you need to take a break, you can.

09:01.040 --> 09:03.040
Maybe you should take
a couple of months off.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.000
Are you sure that you're all right?

09:05.320 --> 09:07.440
You still look pale.

09:07.520 --> 09:10.120
-Yes.
-Maybe you should rest for now.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.480
What happened to her?

10:01.280 --> 10:03.480
SURVIVE HANGING

10:24.840 --> 10:26.720
MOM

10:28.680 --> 10:29.760
Hi, Mom.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.120
Hello?

10:34.880 --> 10:35.960
Mom?

10:37.200 --> 10:38.360
Can you hear me?

10:48.960 --> 10:51.280
SIS

10:52.560 --> 10:53.600
Hi, sis.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.760
Hello.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.560
I'm using your sister's phone.

10:56.640 --> 10:58.680
I couldn't hear you on my phone.

11:00.280 --> 11:01.280
Okay.

11:02.080 --> 11:03.040
What's up?

11:03.640 --> 11:04.640
Nothing.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.240
Can't I just call you?

11:06.600 --> 11:07.600
Of course you can.

11:08.560 --> 11:09.880
Are you with her?

11:09.960 --> 11:12.600
Yes. She stopped by for dinner.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.800
Why didn't you invite me?

11:14.880 --> 11:16.360
Like you would come if I did.

11:16.440 --> 11:17.720
You wouldn't be interested.

11:18.400 --> 11:19.720
Did you call just to complain?

11:20.520 --> 11:22.200
Well, so what?

11:22.280 --> 11:23.880
Can't I complain just a bit?

11:23.960 --> 11:25.640
I thought it was important,

11:25.720 --> 11:27.280
but you're just complaining.

11:27.360 --> 11:30.360
Aren't I allowed to call
my own daughter when I miss her? 

11:32.720 --> 11:33.720
Sure.

11:34.240 --> 11:35.400
Have you had dinner?

11:36.080 --> 11:37.160
Yes.

11:37.840 --> 11:39.440
How is school?

11:39.520 --> 11:40.720
It's fine.

11:41.680 --> 11:43.120
Tell me if anything is wrong.

11:43.200 --> 11:45.160
I had an ominous dream last night.

11:45.240 --> 11:47.360
I dreamed I was chasing something.

11:47.440 --> 11:49.600
Then I found you in front of a bathroom.

11:49.680 --> 11:50.880
You walked in there,

11:50.960 --> 11:52.680
and the door shut in my face.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.560
-Mom.
-Yes?

12:04.560 --> 12:06.640
Do you think the dead
can come back to life?

12:07.160 --> 12:08.360
That's a weird question.

12:09.640 --> 12:10.600
Well...

12:11.840 --> 12:14.480
Today, a cleaner at school hanged herself.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.800
And then she just woke up.

12:17.240 --> 12:18.760
So she didn't really die.

12:18.840 --> 12:21.240
If she had really died,
she would be like your dad.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.480
Dead and gone.

12:22.560 --> 12:24.280
That's not funny, Mom.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.360
I'm serious.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.320
And...

12:31.080 --> 12:32.880
do you think a person can turn into a dog?

12:33.320 --> 12:34.160
What?

12:36.000 --> 12:37.480
Never mind.

12:37.560 --> 12:39.040
You will just make a joke again.

12:40.360 --> 12:41.640
Are you annoyed with me?

12:42.480 --> 12:43.640
No.

12:45.320 --> 12:47.040
I have to hang up now. Let's talk later.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.440
Nanno.

13:46.280 --> 13:47.280
Bam.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.800
Why did you kill her?

13:52.680 --> 13:54.960
She's a really good person.

13:58.640 --> 13:59.800
How did you get in here?

14:01.400 --> 14:03.320
Why did you kill her?

14:04.640 --> 14:05.800
She's so

14:06.360 --> 14:07.920
good to everyone.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.880
Why did you kill her?

14:13.040 --> 14:14.680
She's alive, isn't she?

14:16.000 --> 14:17.040
What else do you want?

14:17.120 --> 14:19.240
You killed someone.

14:20.480 --> 14:22.160
You killed someone, Bam.

14:23.600 --> 14:24.760
You killed someone.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.360
You killed someone.

14:28.560 --> 14:30.040
You killed someone.

15:00.040 --> 15:01.160
Students,

15:01.240 --> 15:03.680
the gravity that makes the apple fall

15:04.840 --> 15:06.920
is the same force
that attracts the moon to the Earth,

15:07.000 --> 15:08.720
and pulls all the stars together,

15:08.800 --> 15:11.280
so that they orbit each other orderly.

15:16.160 --> 15:17.480
Fon.

15:18.160 --> 15:20.040
Fon.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.920
-What the fuck?
-When the teacher was...

15:28.000 --> 15:29.720
-Her neck's broken.
-She's dead.

15:29.800 --> 15:31.240
Don't push.

15:31.320 --> 15:32.800
Students.

15:32.880 --> 15:34.520
Go back to your seats.

15:34.600 --> 15:36.360
She's definitely dead.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.240
Her neck's broken.

15:44.920 --> 15:45.920
Bam.

15:47.120 --> 15:50.160
Thank you so much for your recommendation.

16:03.320 --> 16:07.360
GO AND KILL YOURSELF, FON

16:29.720 --> 16:30.720
Nanno.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.240
Where are you going?

16:33.720 --> 16:36.120
I'm just going to the toilet. What is it?

16:37.920 --> 16:38.760
Nothing.

16:41.680 --> 16:43.480
This is your favorite place, right?

16:44.160 --> 16:46.080
I see you coming in here a lot.

16:47.840 --> 16:48.920
No.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.320
It's just close.

16:50.960 --> 16:51.800
Of course.

16:52.160 --> 16:54.080
Well, excuse me.

17:32.560 --> 17:34.200
Bam, you're so nice.

17:34.280 --> 17:36.120
You didn't have to wait for me.

18:04.800 --> 18:06.080
This one. Here.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.480
They said she came in and saw that.

18:17.960 --> 18:21.000
Really? Someone just...

18:21.560 --> 18:23.240
-Just eat.
-Want some?

18:23.320 --> 18:24.960
It's okay, I'm full.

18:26.160 --> 18:28.160
You're full?
You haven't had your dessert yet.

18:28.920 --> 18:31.640
-I'm on a diet.
-Are you crazy? Just eat properly.

18:33.400 --> 18:35.200
Put that down.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.880
What are you doing?

18:36.960 --> 18:39.000
-What's wrong with you?
-Fah.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.720
-Help. Somebody help.
-Hey.

18:40.800 --> 18:42.080
-What's wrong?
-Help.

18:43.880 --> 18:45.440
Hey, Fah.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.680
-Fah.
-Fah.

18:47.760 --> 18:49.760
What's wrong with Fah?

18:49.840 --> 18:51.920
-What's happening to her?
-Fah?

18:52.280 --> 18:54.520
Fah, what's wrong?

19:06.920 --> 19:09.240
FAH, YOU CRAZY BITCH

19:09.800 --> 19:12.880
-Cherry.
-Cherry.

19:12.960 --> 19:15.320
-Cherry.
-Go away, you assholes.

19:15.400 --> 19:16.640
-Cherry.
-Cherry.

19:16.720 --> 19:18.680
-No.
-Cherry.

19:18.760 --> 19:23.920
-Cherry.
-Cherry.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.480
-Cherry.
-No!

19:25.560 --> 19:27.200
-Cherry.
-Cherry.

19:27.280 --> 19:30.440
CHERRY IS A SLUT

19:32.160 --> 19:33.920
You will have to be
the school representative

19:34.000 --> 19:35.560
for the upcoming competition, Pichit.

19:37.640 --> 19:40.480
TOP, YOU DOG BRAIN

19:52.240 --> 19:55.520
FAT FUCKING PRINCIPAL
DIES OF CLOGGED ARTERY

20:07.200 --> 20:09.280
Who did you tell about the wall?

20:09.360 --> 20:11.320
What's it to you? You don't own it.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.840
It has gone too far.

20:14.920 --> 20:16.680
Can't you see what's happening here?

20:17.320 --> 20:18.200
So what?

20:18.760 --> 20:20.240
Did anyone care

20:20.840 --> 20:23.080
or offer me help
when I was bullied and beaten up?

20:24.440 --> 20:25.960
Nobody did.

20:27.400 --> 20:28.720
So, why the fuss?

20:30.040 --> 20:31.920
You did it to Nanno, didn't you?

20:34.560 --> 20:35.960
Isn't it satisfying

20:36.040 --> 20:38.120
when we can make them pay?

20:40.960 --> 20:41.960
Bam.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.920
Everyone wants to thank you.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.440
DATA HAS INGROWN NAILS

21:14.000 --> 21:15.720
KAO HAS BAD BREATH

21:15.800 --> 21:17.320
YOU DOG BRAIN

21:17.400 --> 21:19.040
GUY IS A CRAZY FUCKER

21:27.640 --> 21:32.280
O, YOU CRIPPLE

21:33.800 --> 21:34.800
O.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.400
O.

22:11.200 --> 22:13.640
O, that's enough for you today.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.520
Please go home.

22:15.600 --> 22:17.680
I haven't even been on the field yet.
I just warmed up.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.880
My shirt still smells of Nanno.

22:20.760 --> 22:21.800
O.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.360
Please, just go home.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.920
-I'll--
-What the hell, Bam?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.280
O, just go home.

22:27.360 --> 22:28.720
-What's with you?
-Please, O.

22:28.800 --> 22:30.200
-Just go home.
-What the hell?

22:30.280 --> 22:31.720
-O!
-Hey!

22:32.520 --> 22:34.560
-O!
-Fuck.

22:36.800 --> 22:38.880
-O.
-O, are you okay?

22:38.960 --> 22:40.400
Damn it.

22:40.480 --> 22:42.320
-What's wrong?
-Get off him.

22:42.400 --> 22:44.240
-Are you all right?
-O.

22:44.320 --> 22:45.320
-Just a moment.
-Calm down.

22:45.400 --> 22:47.360
Calm down. Take it easy.

22:47.440 --> 22:49.840
-Slowly, there.
-Slowly.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.880
-Okay, hold him up.
-Shit, my ankle.

22:51.960 --> 22:53.280
Just a second. Be patient.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.600
Don't worry. We've got you.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.600
-Just hold on.
-Careful.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.840
Fuck.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.640
Fuck.

23:00.520 --> 23:02.040
Fuck.

23:02.120 --> 23:03.160
Why did you do it?

23:04.120 --> 23:05.120
What did I do?

23:05.200 --> 23:06.160
Clean it off right now.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.400
What the fuck is your problem?

23:07.480 --> 23:09.320
-You come with me and clean it off.
-Clean what?

23:09.400 --> 23:10.440
What the fuck?

23:10.520 --> 23:12.320
Can't you see this?
He needs to go to hospital.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.480
-Just get lost.
-Por.

23:13.560 --> 23:14.960
Calm down, Por. Come and help.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.440
Okay, help him up.

23:16.520 --> 23:18.680
Hang on tight.

23:18.760 --> 23:20.760
Slowly. Come on.

23:20.840 --> 23:22.200
Let's go.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.040
Take it easy.

23:24.640 --> 23:25.960
-One second. Slowly.
-Get his arm.

23:26.040 --> 23:27.120
Okay. One, two, three.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.280
Careful, man.

23:28.360 --> 23:30.400
-It hurts. Shit.
-Okay, go.

23:30.480 --> 23:31.640
It hurts.

24:01.480 --> 24:06.400
ANYONE WHO CLEANS THIS WALL WILL DIE

24:30.120 --> 24:31.720
Hurry up.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.840
-Here it is.
-This?

24:35.920 --> 24:38.120
Give me the pen.

25:38.160 --> 25:39.040
Bam.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.600
What's wrong?

25:47.200 --> 25:48.480
I'm sorry, Nanno.

25:50.560 --> 25:51.760
About what?

25:54.800 --> 25:56.160
It's my fault.

25:57.120 --> 25:58.840
It's all because of me.

26:01.160 --> 26:02.480
Even your acne, too.

26:04.040 --> 26:05.320
I'm sorry.

26:18.440 --> 26:19.480
What's wrong?

26:21.120 --> 26:22.440
Didn't you like it?

26:25.520 --> 26:27.040
When my face stank

26:28.120 --> 26:29.520
you seemed satisfied.

26:30.920 --> 26:32.520
When Teng barked like a dog, too.

26:34.240 --> 26:35.800
When you have the power,

26:36.680 --> 26:38.160
it's all fun and games, right?

26:39.560 --> 26:41.480
You can write anything about anyone.

26:45.520 --> 26:46.720
Who the hell are you?

26:48.800 --> 26:50.280
Look around you, Bam.

26:51.720 --> 26:53.440
The ones who wrote on the wall

26:54.600 --> 26:56.240
are normally such good people.

26:58.800 --> 26:59.880
So, what exactly

27:00.920 --> 27:02.480
made them like this?

27:05.400 --> 27:06.880
Do you know, there's no such thing

27:08.280 --> 27:09.280
as a weak person?

27:09.360 --> 27:12.440
ANYONE WHO CLEANS THIS WALL WILL DIE

27:14.160 --> 27:15.040
You.

27:15.760 --> 27:16.880
Why are you doing this?

27:17.440 --> 27:18.320
Me?

27:19.240 --> 27:20.360
I did this?

27:21.040 --> 27:22.440
Think again, Bam.

27:22.960 --> 27:24.320
I haven't done anything.

27:24.840 --> 27:25.840
That wall,

27:26.600 --> 27:28.480
I never once wrote on it.

27:29.840 --> 27:32.520
So, who exactly started this?

27:33.920 --> 27:34.920
Who exactly

27:35.680 --> 27:38.760
spread this all over the school?

27:40.200 --> 27:42.000
What about O limping over there,

27:42.080 --> 27:43.520
unable to play football again?

27:44.160 --> 27:45.160
Who is to blame?

27:46.920 --> 27:48.240
-You.
-Bam.

27:56.680 --> 27:59.200
Hurting me won't solve anything.

28:00.120 --> 28:02.080
You know what you have to do.

28:02.720 --> 28:03.880
You just don't have the guts.

28:04.720 --> 28:06.240
Why not?

28:06.320 --> 28:07.400
It would be a violent death.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.760
You already killed someone.

28:10.280 --> 28:11.520
Nanno, you bitch.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.280
Stop it right now.

28:13.720 --> 28:15.560
If I could shut you up for good right now,

28:15.640 --> 28:17.240
I would do it.

28:18.640 --> 28:19.640
But you can.

28:20.360 --> 28:21.360
Ta-da!

28:22.120 --> 28:23.400
A pen.

28:23.480 --> 28:24.360
Take it.

28:24.840 --> 28:26.360
Go ahead and write.

28:35.160 --> 28:36.920
Don't pretend to be so innocent.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.920
It's just a way to let off steam.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.840
Let it all out.

28:42.040 --> 28:43.520
Use your thoughtless writing

28:44.280 --> 28:45.760
that you thought would do no harm.

28:45.840 --> 28:46.920
No!

28:48.840 --> 28:49.800
No.

28:57.160 --> 28:58.480
Admit it.

28:59.560 --> 29:00.880
You don't have the guts

29:01.960 --> 29:04.320
to take responsibility
for what you started.

29:09.400 --> 29:10.400
Watch me.

29:16.040 --> 29:17.520
Everyone.

29:17.600 --> 29:19.760
Bam is going to clean the wall.

29:37.040 --> 29:38.360
Bam!

29:48.200 --> 29:49.160
There she is!

29:53.200 --> 29:54.560
-Bam!
-Stop it!

29:56.320 --> 29:58.040
Where are you going?

30:00.440 --> 30:01.920
Stop, Bam!

30:02.000 --> 30:03.840
-Stop! No!
-Bam.

30:03.920 --> 30:07.240
-Bam.
-Stop right now.

30:07.320 --> 30:08.600
Stop. Come out.

30:08.680 --> 30:10.680
Bam. Stop it, Bam.

30:15.160 --> 30:16.640
Bam, open the door.

30:16.720 --> 30:18.080
Why won't it come off?

30:19.960 --> 30:21.360
Bam, open up.

30:24.720 --> 30:26.200
Bam.

30:26.280 --> 30:27.120
Open up, Bam.

